# /settings' Permission mode row: Right is `/permissions <mode>` with its
# notices, twice round (auto -> full access -> ask). Both binaries' menus
# have fx's fourteen rows, so one Down count lands both on the row (a count
# per binary dated from before xfx's Fast and Ultra rows).
# fx's harness launches it with FX_SOUND=0; xfx is given the same start.
xfx: env XFX_SOUND=off
wait 2
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.4
snap marked
key Right
wait 0.8
snap full
home full
key Right
wait 0.8
snap ask
home ask
key Escape
wait 0.5
snap esc
